@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Serif CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
left to right direction
package "同一分段中的两个桶（初始化示意）" {
  object "桶 0" as B0 {
    槽 0：桶头
    槽 1：空闲
    槽 2：空闲
    槽 3：空闲
  }
  object "分段空闲链" as F {
    DirFreeStart = 1
    1 → 2 → 3 → 5 → 6 → 7
  }
  object "桶 1" as B1 {
    槽 4：桶头
    槽 5：空闲
    槽 6：空闲
    槽 7：空闲
  }
}
B0 .. F : 非桶头空闲槽
F .. B1 : 非桶头空闲槽
note bottom of F
  桶头不进入空闲链
  分配时先桶头，再本桶空槽，最后分段空闲链
  已用项通过 next 接入目标桶的碰撞链
  图中槽号为分段内索引
end note
@enduml
